  "notes": "Playful parody of a Palantir/defense ops console applied to a family vacation: 'UNCLASSIFIED // FAMILY OPS' banner text in green caps, 'Response Plans', 'Mission scrub', 'Weather Intel / NOAA', 'Risk watch'. GitHub-dark palette (#0d1117/#161b22/#30363d with #58a6ff blue). Corners 1–2px — near-square. Status pills are tinted dark fills with colored caps text (blue transit, amber pending/watch, green go, gray dinner transit). Timeline bars are outlined colored rectangles color-coded per family/type with truncated caps labels; floating map panels are bordered cards with collapse chevrons. Selecting items re-centers the map and swaps the right inspector (verified live). Panels scroll independently. Filed novel values for filter placement (floating map overlay panel) and gantt playback cursor."
}
